<section class="repository-editor" data-repository-editor aria-labelledby="repository-editor-title">
 <h2 id="repository-editor-title">MINSEC 콘텐츠 편집</h2><p>GitHub 저장소의 편집 권한으로 로그인합니다. 저장하면 공개 사이트 배포가 자동으로 시작됩니다.</p>
 <p class="notice" data-repo-status role="status">GitHub 편집 연결을 확인합니다.</p>
 <div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" data-repo-login type="button">GitHub 편집 권한으로 로그인</button><button class="button secondary" data-repo-logout type="button" hidden>편집 연결 해제</button><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/K-MIN-SEC/K-MIN-SEC.github.io/actions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">배포 상태 ↗</a></div>
 <div data-repo-workspace hidden>
  <nav class="repo-tabs" aria-label="편집 대상"><button type="button" data-repo-tab="projects">프로젝트</button><button type="button" data-repo-tab="play">Play</button><button type="button" data-repo-tab="devlog">Devlog</button><button type="button" data-repo-tab="site">내 프로필</button></nav>
  <div class="repo-layout"><aside><h3>목록</h3><div data-repo-list></div><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-repo-new>+ 새로 작성</button></aside><form data-repo-form><h3 data-repo-heading>편집할 항목을 선택해 주세요.</h3><div data-repo-fields></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit" data-repo-save>저장하고 배포</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-repo-delete>삭제하고 배포</button></div></form></div>
 </div>
</section>
<script>import '../lib/repository-editor';</script>
<style>
 .repository-editor{margin:35px 0}.repo-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:24px 0}.repo-tabs button{padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid #536148;border-radius:8px;background:#1d291a;color:inherit}.repo-tabs button[aria-current]{border-color:#c0eb98;color:#c0eb98}.repo-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:210px minmax(0,1fr);gap:30px}.repo-layout aside{border-right:1px solid #35402d;padding-right:20px}.repo-layout :global([data-repo-list] button){display:block;text-align:left;width:100%;padding:12px 6px;color:inherit;background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #35402d}.repo-layout form :global(label){display:grid;gap:8px;margin:18px 0}.repo-layout form :global(fieldset){padding:18px;border:1px solid #35402d;border-radius:10px;margin:15px 0}.repo-layout form :global(textarea){min-height:130px}.repo-layout form :global(.repo-nested-item){padding:14px;background:#182017;margin:15px 0;border-radius:10px}.repo-layout form :global(small){color:#adba9f}.repo-layout form :global(.repo-array-actions){display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.repo-layout form :global(button){cursor:pointer}.repo-layout form :global(input[type=checkbox]){width:auto;justify-self:start}.repo-layout form :global(.repo-preview){max-width:280px;max-height:160px;object-fit:cover}@media(max-width:700px){.repo-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.repo-layout aside{border-right:0;padding:0}}
</style>
